	quest.032AC795543DE0AC.quest_desc: ["During the rushes, mutant infighting is frequent… and so is collateral damage. Pray you’re not in the crossfire"]
	quest.032AC795543DE0AC.quest_subtitle: "Every 10 days, the mutant forces grow stronger. Stay vigilant"
	quest.142F9A56AA9733DD.quest_desc: [
		"No one knows how it began. Some blame a failed experiment, others speak of ancient powers awakening. What’s certain is the world is broken."
		""
		"The sun scorches. Acid rain corrodes. Violent storms rage. And when the winds die, a deadly cold follows."
		""
		"Humanity survives with scraps of shelter and technology. But hidden in this shattered world is the Restoration Protocol, the key to restoring balance."
		""
		"Complete it, and stop the fury of the elements."
		""
		"Your journey begins now. Complete the Restoration Protocol. Restore the World!"
	]
	quest.142F9A56AA9733DD.title: "Welcome - The Shattered Skies"
	quest.14B5D4A1521A62FE.quest_desc: ["A magnet can always come in handy. It’s up to you to choose the one that fits your needs"]
	quest.184375F02F6E1387.quest_desc: ["A utility belt that holds your tools"]
	quest.184375F02F6E1387.quest_subtitle: "Please check your key binds"
	quest.190D1C0437C4C8E7.quest_subtitle: "Return winter to peace, and frost to balance"
	quest.1D6539126D759B1F.quest_subtitle: "A vial to bring the skeleton back from the void"
	quest.1E91D619AB39DC4C.quest_subtitle: "If you need more force loaded chunk"
